WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.470
Your cells and the cells in a
leaf share the same basic kit.

2
00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:06.870
Both have a nucleus, cytoplasm,

3
00:00:06.920 --> 00:00:09.390
a cell membrane and mitochondria.

4
00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:13.330
But the leaf cell has three
extra parts that yours don't.

5
00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:14.730
What are those extra parts for?

6
00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:17.690
And why don't your cells need them?

7
00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:21.130
In this mission, you'll look
inside an animal cell and a plant

8
00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:23.450
cell, and name the parts they share.

9
00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:25.810
You'll meet the plant
cell's three extras,

10
00:00:25.860 --> 00:00:28.090
and what each one does.

11
00:00:28.140 --> 00:00:31.110
And you'll see how cells
build up into tissues,

12
00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:33.450
organs and organ systems.

13
00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:37.710
Your mission: explain what a
plant cell's extra parts are for.
